    public static final String TEXT = new StringBuilder()
            .append("## 0.79.0 (2026-10-24)\012\012* **TikTok:** On PineDrama, Hushfeed's settings now say to restart PineDrama instead of TikTok (#156).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Hide spam comments switch hides bot comments that push links, contacts or free followers. Your own comments and the creator's stay (#187).\012\012* **TikTok:** Hide videos you have already seen takes watched videos out of For You again (#172).\012\012* **TikTok:** With the AMOLED dark theme, the comment bar under a photo post is black now (#171).\012\012* **TikTok:** Use an imported font now works on PineDrama, and bold text stays bold (#243).\012\012* **TikTok:** The Scrolling comments on videos preset in Feature Gate Lab now tells you it only works on videos TikTok turned it on for (#98).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Allow photo comments patch for PineDrama lets the comment box ask TikTok's server about photo comments, like TikTok does (#156).\012\012* **TikTok:** PineDrama moves to 47.5.3. Six more patches run on it now, so Morphe Manager offers 95 patches for it (#156).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Report a newer phone to effects switch helps with effects that say they don't work on your phone (#176).\012\012* **TikTok:** PineDrama's saved stickers now show every sticker you saved instead of the first 100 (#214).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new LIVE recording source choice can record your screen while you watch a LIVE (#37).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Blur the video behind the bar switch frosts the Liquid glass look's bar on Android 12 and up (#231).\012\012* **TikTok:** Dark LIVE panels in dark mode now darkens the light pieces that were left in LIVE rooms (#159).\012\012* **TikTok:** Tag saved videos with their details now really adds the title, creator, date and link to saved videos.\012\012* **TikTok:** Hide TikTok's Auto scroll button also hides the Auto scroll switch on tablets and unfolded foldables (#234).\012\012* **TikTok:** The README now says to patch the 47.5.3 bundle on a phone and the APK on a computer.\012\012* **TikTok:** With Keep Clear display across videos off, the buttons come back as your swipe ends instead of jumping in later (#232).\012\012* **TikTok:** With See-through bottom bar on, the caption and buttons no longer drop over the tabs after a swipe (#232).\012\012* **TikTok:** Long press to Save the frame on screen as a photo works again on 47.5.3.\012\012* **TikTok:** Remove feed ads also removes the smaller Lemon8 card in For You.\012\012* **TikTok:** The filtered count and the budget label no longer show on the Shop and Nearby tabs.\012\012* **TikTok:** With Dark LIVE panels in dark mode on, a room's viewer ranking opens dark again (#159).\012\012* **TikTok:** The README says to give morphe-desktop 2 GB of memory when you patch everything on a computer (#220).\012\012* **TikTok:** With Double tap set to Do nothing, a single tap pauses or plays right away (#239).\012\012* **TikTok:** The build moves to Gradle 9.8.2.\012\012* **TikTok:** The README lists the parts of Hushfeed's settings an add-on bundle can rely on.\012\012* **TikTok:** What's new keeps only the newest releases and Full changelog has the rest, which makes the extension smaller.\012\012* **TikTok:** Glass lens on the current tab now slides to the next tab every time (#231).\012\012* **TikTok:** With Automatic Clear display on, a search result you open again clears again (#84).\012\012* **TikTok:** LIVE recording quality also offers Original, 1080p, 720p, 540p and 360p (#203).\012\012* **TikTok:** When the download quality list stops below 720p, it also offers the video's own taller H.264 or HEVC version (#240).\012\012* **TikTok:** Show where commenters are from finds a country more often (#201).\012\012* **TikTok:** Latest first on Following keeps the posts below your video in date order as more load (#226).\012\012* **TikTok:** Profile and Liked grids can sort by Least viewed first and Least liked first, load more videos by themselves and have a sort button in the corner (#180).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Open the Story when a creator is LIVE switch opens their Story first when you tap their picture (#233).\012\012* **TikTok:** With Record LIVEs you watch on, a LIVE room's Share sheet has a LIVE recording quality row (#203).\012\012* **TikTok:** Offer LIVE quality in more rooms now covers gaming and football LIVE rooms too (#37).\012\012* **TikTok:** In dark mode, the newer video quality picker in a LIVE room is readable again (#57).\012\012* **TikTok:** A LIVE room stays dark when your phone switches between light and dark (#159).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Allow Add to Story anyway switch brings back Add to Story when a creator turned off content reuse (#88).\012\012* **TikTok:** With Region spoof matching the locale and time zone, chat date headers follow the preset's time zone (#184, #198).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Turn on Thoughts switch shows Thoughts for accounts TikTok left out (#186).\012\012* **TikTok:** Keep photos as TikTok sent them now covers stickers that don't move too (#229).\012\012* **TikTok:** Keep the screen's brightness in the camera now covers the front flash and the fill light too (#200).\012\012## 0.78.0 (2026-10-22)\012\012* **TikTok:** Hushfeed moves to TikTok 47.5.3, and 47.4.3 is dropped. Patch the 47.5.3 APK with the same signing key and your login and settings stay. PineDrama stays on 47.4.3.\012\012* **TikTok:** Remove unused language packs now works on PineDrama 47.4.3 too.\012\012* **TikTok:** Search loaded activity shows its search bar on the Inbox's Activity page again.\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Double tap by corner switch gives each quarter of the video its own double tap action. The idea and first version came from @OmerKurdi79 (#232).\012\012* **TikTok:** Settings search remembers your last ten searches. Tap one to run it again, or remove it with the bin (#232).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Keep Clear display across videos switch is on by default. Turn it off and a Clear display you turn on lasts for that video only (#232).\012\012* **TikTok:** Patching is faster. A full desktop run went from 89 to 60 seconds, and the APK it makes is the same.\012\012* **TikTok:** Sort loaded videos on profile grids orders the videos a profile or Liked grid has loaded by date, length, views or likes (#180).\012\012* **TikTok:** Fit the video to the screen shows photo slideshows whole on squarer screens too (#188).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Keep captions available switch brings back TikTok's Captions switch where TikTok hides it. Restart TikTok after turning it on (#217).\012\012* **TikTok:** Match locale and timezone to country now gives TikTok that country's time zone from the start, daylight saving included (#184, #198).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Seek bar on sound previews switch adds a bar you can tap or drag while a sound's preview plays (#185).\012\012* **TikTok:** Keep faded controls in Clear display keeps the like, comment, save and share buttons on screen again (#209).\012\012* **TikTok:** The diagnostic report no longer calls the video controls broken on accounts without the Following stories button (#209).\012\012* **TikTok:** With Log diagnostics on, each LIVE comment line names its room with a short code instead of the room id (#110).\012\012* **TikTok:** Hushfeed now needs Morphe Manager 2.0.0 or newer, or morphe-desktop 1.19.0 on a computer. Patching takes about half as long.\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Hide Balance in the profile menu switch takes Balance out of the menu your profile's top right button opens (#194).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Keep photos as TikTok sent them switch saves photos as the HEIF or WebP file TikTok sent instead of a JPEG (#229).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Glass lens on the current tab switch puts a small piece of glass behind the tab you're on (#231, #124).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Hide the TikTok Minis icons in the profile menu switch makes that menu shorter (#230).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Turn off the swipe to the side menu switch stops a right swipe on For You from opening TikTok's side menu (#213).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Don't auto translate videos switch keeps video descriptions and captions in the language they were made in. Restart TikTok after turning it on (#194).\012\012* **TikTok:** Accent color now colors the unread count on the Inbox tab and the unread dots too (#192).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Open the comments at full height switch opens the comment sheet all the way up (#191).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Keep the screen's brightness in the camera switch stops TikTok's camera from turning your screen brighter (#200).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Long-press Profile for Watch history switch opens Watch history when you hold the Profile tab (#199).\012\012* **TikTok:** In Simplified Chinese, Profile in Hushfeed's settings now reads 个人主页 instead of \"company profile\".\012\012* **TikTok:** A new LIVE recording quality choice records LIVEs at the room's quality, the highest or the lowest (#203).\012\012* **TikTok:** Turning on See-through bottom bar while TikTok is open no longer brings back the black strip under videos after the first swipe (#145).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Hide the AI Cast button switch takes AI Cast off the camera's side toolbar.\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Latest first on Following switch plays each batch of Following posts newest first. Restart TikTok after turning it on (#226).\012\012* **TikTok:** On a Galaxy with Use system font on, your font now shows on Watch history, Activity center and TikTok's other web pages too (#7).\012\012* **TikTok:** With See-through bottom bar on by itself, portrait videos now reach the bottom of the screen behind the tabs (#145, #218).\012\012* **TikTok:** A new Where the time goes choice can put the time above the progress bar in the feed (#173).\012\012* **TikTok:** Accent color now colors the \"You may like\" words on the search page too (#163).\012\012* **TikTok:** Downloads lists the saves under way and the last five that finished, and Saves at once lets up to 3 run together (#27).\012")
            .toString();

    /** The translated notes for a settings table tag (lower case, as L10n reads it), or null. */
    public static String translated(String tag) {
        if (tag == null) return null;
        switch (tag) {
            case "az":
                return NOTES_AZ;
            case "de":
                return NOTES_DE;
            case "es":
                return NOTES_ES;
            case "in":
            case "id":
                return NOTES_IN;
            case "it":
                return NOTES_IT;
            case "pt-rbr":
                return NOTES_PT_RBR;
            case "ru":
                return NOTES_RU;
            case "tr":
                return NOTES_TR;
            default: return null;
        }
    }

